127 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (Our project  proposes an AI-Assisted Exam Proctoring System with Human Review for Nile International University. The system supports remote examinations while protecting academic fairness, student privacy and due process. It integrates with the university Moodle Learning Management System \(LMS\), supports exam setup, student preparation, identity verification, proctoring, event capture, human review and formal academic-integrity case handling. The central design principle is that artificial intelligence identifies and records potentially relevant events; it does not decide that a student committed misconduct. AI-generated flags are evidence for a human review process only. A reviewer classifies each flagged event, and suspected misconduct is referred to the Academic Integrity Committee. No grade penalty is applied before the committee decision.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
